prompt:
Create an original 1536×1024 true-transparent RGBA sprite sheet for JAMVERSE '96. Use the supplied Leo gameplay sprite only as the identity and pixel-art style reference. Draw exactly six distinct complete full-body Leo poses in a strict three-column by two-row grid, row-major, with broad transparent gutters and outer margins. Each pose must fit entirely in its own cell at a consistent scale and camera, with full long hair, hands and shoes inside the cell. Crisp readable 1990s arcade pixel-art clusters and outlines.

